考试 & 她对这次的测试准备得不够充分\nC) 她的竞争对手的分数比她高 & 对她来说，这个测试太简单了\nD) 她没有通过考试 & 她的竞争对手的分数比她高\nE) 她没有通过考试 & 对她来说，这个测试太简单了\nF) 她的竞争对手的分数比她高 & 老师对小白有偏见","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003592134210119085,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a74c9aa9dc5a833d9dd0","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794484044289,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:47:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"18b4b9b0e39f4e19a11b2fdeb9826544"}